namespace raptor {

/*! \mainpage RAPtor code documentation
 *
 * RAPtor is a general, high performance algebraic multigrid solver.
 * Include `raptor.hpp` to use the library.
 *
 * <H3>Main multigrid and linear algebra classes</H3>
 *
 * - Multilevel and ParMultilevel
 * - Level and ParLevel
 * - Vector and ParVector
 * - Matrix and ParMatrix
 * - Coordinate and compressed matrices: ParCOOMatrix, ParCSRMatrix, ParCSCMatrix
 * - Block matrices: ParBCOOMatrix, ParBSRMatrix, ParBSCMatrix
 *
 * <H3>Parallel communication classes</H3>
 * - Communicator CommPkg
 * - Communication Topology
 * - Communication Partition
 *
 * <H3>Multigrid solver classes</H3>
 * - ParRugeStubenSolver (classical AMG) with components:
 *   - Strength: ParCSRMatrix::strength
 *   - Coarsening: \link par_cf_splitting.hpp CF splitting \endlink
 *     (RS, CLJP, Falgout, PMIS, HMIS)
 *   - Interpolation: \link par_interpolation.hpp interpolation \endlink
 *     (direct, modified classical, extended, one-point)
 * - ParAIRSolver (approximate ideal restriction)
 * - ParSmoothedAggregationSolver with components:
 *   - Strength: ParCSRMatrix::strength
 *   - Aggregation: ParCSRMatrix::aggregate and \link par_mis.hpp mis2 \endlink
 *   - Tentative prolongation: ParCSRMatrix::fit_candidates
 *   - Smoothed prolongation: \link par_prolongation.hpp jacobi_prolongation \endlink
 * - Relaxation: \link par_relax.hpp parallel relaxation \endlink
 *   (Jacobi, SOR, SSOR, block Jacobi)
 *
 * <H3>Krylov methods</H3>
 * - \link par_cg.hpp CG and preconditioned CG \endlink
 * - \link par_bicgstab.hpp BiCGStab and preconditioned BiCGStab \endlink
 *
 * <H3>Matrix gallery and I/O</H3>
 * - \link par_stencil.hpp Stencil problems \endlink and
 *   \link diffusion.hpp rotated anisotropic diffusion \endlink
 * - \link par_random.hpp Random matrices \endlink
 * - \link par_matrix_market.hpp Matrix Market \endlink and
 *   \link par_matrix_IO.hpp binary \endlink readers
 *
 * <H3>External interfaces</H3>
 * Built only when the corresponding CMake option is enabled:
 * - \link hypre_wrapper.hpp hypre \endlink (<tt>WITH_HYPRE</tt>)
 * - \link mfem_wrapper.hpp MFEM \endlink (<tt>WITH_MFEM</tt>)
 * - \link petsc_wrapper.hpp PETSc \endlink (<tt>WITH_PETSC</tt>)
 * - \link trilinos_wrapper.hpp Trilinos MueLu \endlink (<tt>WITH_MUELU</tt>)
 */
}
